  "gameData": {
    "backstory": "Born in the heart of Subchain City, Cipher learned the relentless rhythm of survival early. His parents, legendary DRIP smugglers, were iced by the Featherhood, leaving him to fend for himself amongst the rusted ruins and scavenging ringleaders. Now, he uses his inherited grit and natural musical talent to drum up chaos and DRIP wherever he can.",
    "class": "Rhythm Raider",
    "name": "Cipher 'Clatterbones' Quackstone",
    "personality": "Resourceful, Cipher never wastes anything, be it scraps of metal or opportunities to cause a ruckus. Restless, Drumming is more than a talent; it's a nervous tick, a constant beat fueling his actions. Stoic, Having learned to rely on himself, Cipher keeps his emotions locked down, preferring the language of sticks on metal.",
